sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Utilisateur
    participant F as Frontend (AuthContext / api.js)
    participant B as Backend (routes_postgres/auth.js)
    participant M as Middleware auth.js
    participant D as PostgreSQL (users, revoked_tokens)

    U->>F: Saisit email + mot de passe
    F->>B: POST /api/auth/login
    B->>D: SELECT user WHERE email
    D-->>B: Utilisateur + hash du mot de passe
    B->>B: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
    B->>B: jwt.sign({userId, email, role})
    B-->>F: { token, user }
    F->>F: localStorage.setItem('token', token)

    Note over F,B: Requetes suivantes
    F->>B: GET /api/xxx (Authorization: Bearer token)
    B->>M: authenticateToken
    M->>D: isTokenRevoked(token) ?
    D-->>M: non revoque
    M->>M: jwt.verify(token)
    M-->>B: req.user = { id, role }
    B-->>F: Reponse

    Note over U,D: Deconnexion
    U->>F: Clique "Deconnexion"
    F->>B: POST /api/auth/logout
    B->>D: INSERT INTO revoked_tokens
    B-->>F: { success: true }
    F->>F: localStorage.removeItem('token')
